retained-unavailable = The safety net is not available.
retained-busy = A running file operation is using this item. Try again when it finishes.
retained-not-ready = This item needs attention before it can be restored or deleted. Restart Navo to check it again.
retained-missing = This item is no longer in Recently deleted.
retained-open-failed = Recently deleted cannot be opened: { $error }
retained-list-failed = Recently deleted cannot be read: { $error }
retained-restore-failed = { $name } was not restored: { $error }
retained-purge-failed = { $name } was not deleted: { $error }
retained-name-taken = { $name } was not restored: every “(restored)” name in its folder is taken.
git-off = Git is turned off.
clipboard-off = The clipboard history is turned off.
clipboard-busy = The clipboard history is busy. Try again in a moment.
clipboard-moved-aside = The clipboard history file was damaged. Navo set it aside and started an empty history.
clipboard-open-failed = The clipboard history could not be opened, so it stays off.
clipboard-secrets-need-windows = Secrets need Windows.
clipboard-refused = That change is not allowed for this item.
clipboard-too-large = That is too large to keep.
clipboard-saved-full = The saved list is full. Delete an item first.
clipboard-not-found = That item is gone.
clipboard-failed = The clipboard action failed. Nothing was changed.
clipboard-paused = Recording is paused. Copies are not kept until you resume it.
clipboard-recording-failed = The clipboard history is not recording. Turn it off and on again in Settings.
clipboard-not-deleted = The clipboard data was not deleted. Close other programs that use it and try again.
